{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Game Shop Simulator is a chill first-person simulation where every detail of running a Game store comes alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Create the ultimate video game store! where you sell video games, Consoles, or Gaming Notebooks, this game lets you live out your dream of running a thriving gaming business.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Store Management</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Determine where products are displayed, manage your inventory, and keep track of popular trends and adjust to the ever-changing demand of the market. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Customize Store</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Design and personalize your own store, organize shelves and optimize for efficiency and aesthetics. Every detail is yours to customize, making your store truly one of a kind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Expands your Store</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Reinvest your profits to take your shop to the next level! Expand your store, License new game systems and hire more staff to become the best game store in town.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3848580?t=1751669832","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3848580/f7b9062cb7f25b8f73c8a353c3671ee3203ee809/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1751669832","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3848580/2025a94840d38b3a17dd5aeee53e47eaa621a450/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1751669832","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3848580/2025a94840d38b3a17dd5aeee53e47eaa621a450/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1751669832","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"This Game may contain content not appropriate for all ages, or may not be appropriate for viewing at work: General Mature Content"},"